## Goal
See how the treated and untreated samples separate on a PCA of the gene-level counts. The
analysis places the six rnaseq_bulk samples (A1-A3 untreated, B1-B3 treated) on the leading
principal components of their variance-stabilised gene-level counts, coloured by `condition`,
and reports the fraction of variance each component explains. It makes no statistical claim
about differential expression; that is sub-stage 02.02's question.

