## Execution
Runs: batch
One job through the workspace's configured executor, submitted with
`_system/executorlib.py submit`, running `scripts/sample_pca.py` in `gars-bio`. Requested
resources: 1 CPU, 4 GB memory, 30 minutes. Expected wall time is under 5 minutes (six samples);
total output under 1 MB.
